{
  "id": "gossip_odile",
  "service": "ElevenLabs text-to-speech",
  "lines": {
    "greet": {
      "hash": "122df6943914bb80",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "Well now, a new face on the square. Sit, sit. Colin and I see everything from this bench.",
      "chars": 89,
      "chars_total": 36,
      "request_id": "QxkR8kU6YkcQv4be2Dva",
      "seconds": 6.12,
      "mouth": "899997542000000039999449983477543127643100100000033984100000003358520000000100069986667777779563686641565226645511555432000"
    },
    "town": {
      "hash": "f941ae4c98841eeb",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "Saint-Philippe is small. Everyone knows who paid the baker and who did not, and Colin knows twice as much.",
      "chars": 106,
      "chars_total": 42,
      "request_id": "FGG2fg1fD56SeLO6vnlP",
      "seconds": 7.51,
      "mouth": "2983387751254327765321001979979777999976210000000010078259998548489852176420001001004999996776776520000000101000582398887776888743121698753475264311000"
    },
    "barn": {
      "hash": "cd0eb38df92bec8f",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "They say the old still barn is not empty at night. Lights, and a truck with no plates. I say nothing.",
      "chars": 101,
      "chars_total": 40,
      "request_id": "2vWT0ejaQLQi1pT25Co4",
      "seconds": 6.45,
      "mouth": "9979599996953999541298658776458588625863477446654311000010005777762111000010007872369851026677611655311100001000069694877652132000"
    },
    "more": {
      "hash": "99894fcdc8a742e1",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "There is more, if you have the time. What would you like to hear?",
      "chars": 65,
      "chars_total": 26,
      "request_id": "9Nht3buAUzxW2uP1F8SJ",
      "seconds": 3.17,
      "mouth": "8999678999726325777446127655420000000007921985799862146675531100"
    },
    "bell": {
      "hash": "79e09ed87e04376c",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "The church bell rings on the hour, and I set my watch by it. The priest oils the rope himself, you know.",
      "chars": 104,
      "chars_total": 42,
      "request_id": "yNtFRur9KD5eUjRUKqeG",
      "seconds": 7.88,
      "mouth": "94579994355431000012599997655688766421000576563689776521000001100688974499247776766330566655201000011006329998312118999985287897730005733485311000010058653200"
    },
    "courier": {
      "hash": "dae20eb0f1f78a20",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "The Courier is a dollar at the newsstand. Read it before you talk to anyone, and you will sound clever.",
      "chars": 103,
      "chars_total": 41,
      "request_id": "FI4OsV6QfF25EYi7jsIw",
      "seconds": 6.07,
      "mouth": "82299998998357674499998642643667786314543320000100100179998356328666249831555766665532000001000036666564327666414765332100"
    },
    "mine": {
      "hash": "cd7cdede4215dc99",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "They are digging coal again at East Rise. Hard work, honest pay. My knees say no, thank you.",
      "chars": 92,
      "chars_total": 37,
      "request_id": "G50awC1EiA8XxBjfKWfY",
      "seconds": 5.58,
      "mouth": "9999659968884499989558867723783216765531000000001999569986301115786311897531000000010039999994367666641465212100"
    },
    "more2": {
      "hash": "f730d23503989eab",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "Still listening? Good. A man needs an audience.",
      "chars": 47,
      "chars_total": 19,
      "request_id": "0FPK65Q7tGpsyytgLa8T",
      "seconds": 2.94,
      "mouth": "99998458753000001001000998431000111004998788963777664431000"
    },
    "market": {
      "hash": "682b70f3835466b0",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "The market is where the apples go. Sell at the stalls, never to the first man who names a price.",
      "chars": 96,
      "chars_total": 38,
      "request_id": "vF7MoMOk5y54Aa26rCb4",
      "seconds": 5.93,
      "mouth": "99998329568787987483464156421553200000100138998863432166543100001010007999698239584359842466654300048766663252155432100"
    },
    "hostel": {
      "hash": "96b56958d256442c",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "The hostel clerk is kind to strangers. A bed, a key, and a car if you ask nicely. Everyone starts there.",
      "chars": 104,
      "chars_total": 42,
      "request_id": "LtQW9xjMoZRCuJtLgIzV",
      "seconds": 6.31,
      "mouth": "9998417535998620210005942287773342487756531110010006759998521743499732665259998721776621466422111000100999987762238754336543000"
    },
    "who": {
      "hash": "aa3d3295fc5cf74d",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "Odilon Ferrand, retired from the ferry. Forty years of watching people come and go. Now I watch them stay.",
      "chars": 106,
      "chars_total": 42,
      "request_id": "2DfPmHNpih0HAZjw6WFJ",
      "seconds": 6.45,
      "mouth": "985599875369877643210149429999533876522876542000011000079426889988545545954685195121287766467553100110100399878786232775314654200"
    },
    "again": {
      "hash": "f98f2725dc03fc06",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "Anything else? My bench is free.",
      "chars": 32,
      "chars_total": 13,
      "request_id": "qjKIraSAQeNfv66HuM9j",
      "seconds": 1.68,
      "mouth": "9995998862221000058657735732254100"
    },
    "bye": {
      "hash": "b6a38082dbbbc255",
      "date": "2026-11-23",
      "voice_id": "W2BFXIBAz50X1hk8EohV",
      "voice_name": "Martin - Ultra High Quality",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "Come back when you have news. I will pay in coffee. Or in secrets.",
      "chars": 66,
      "chars_total": 26,
      "request_id": "vFA3YW747ZU6ZIedR4WA",
      "seconds": 3.95,
      "mouth": "7987996157779985788764111000000000069999618987662784222100004899872362177631100"
    }
  },
